plaintext
* NMOS transistor QN
M1 2 2 3 3 NMOS

* PMOS transistor QP
M2 3 2 4 4 PMOS

* Voltage source VC
VVC 2 0 DC VDD

* Input voltage source VI
VI 4 0 DC 0

* Capacitor
C1 5 0 <Capacitance_Value>

* Node connections
.node 3 connects to QP drain and QN source
.node 2 connects to QN gate, QP gate, and QN drain
.node 4 is input terminal connected to VI 
.node 5 is output terminal (Vo), connected to capacitor C

.end